 "fields": "as the standards map: zones [{t, codes, to, spot}]. to: the section that holds the proof (the title jumps there); each code is a chip that scrolls to the row naming it (standardsmap.js handles data-smap-code clicks). spot picks the drawn part the arc touches: ro-skid -> RO rack, storage-tank -> tank and loop, gauge -> control panel, weld -> skid frame (fabrication), binder -> binders; any other spot gets a node with no arc. Zones take the slots left top, right top, right bottom, left bottom, bottom in order (five at most on the rings; more stack under the stage).",
